<title>BELGIUM: EMU budget pact ahead of Dublin summit doubtful.</title>
<headline>EMU budget pact ahead of Dublin summit doubtful.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>European Union agreement on a budget stability pact for countries inside monetary union may not be attainable before a summit of EU leaders in December, Irish Finance minister Ruairi Quinn said on Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;I think it's not possible to say whether the political parameters will be signed off&quot; in Dublin, Quinn told a news conference.</p>
<p>He added, however, that a report detailing substantial on the subject will be ready for EU leaders meeting on December 13 and 14.</p>
<p>-- Brussels newsroom 32 2 2876830</p>
</text>
